				<crossref let="o" cid="c1500240.1"/>
				 the Levites who returned from exile:The families of Jeshua and Kadmiel (descendants of Hodaviah) 74
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v15002041"/>
			<v n="41">
				The singers 
				<crossref let="p" cid="c1500241.1"/>
				 of the family of Asaph 128
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v15002042"/>
			<v n="42">
				The gatekeepers 
				<crossref let="q" cid="c1500242.1"/>
				 of the families of Shallum, Ater, Talmon, Akkub, Hatita, and Shobai 139
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v15002043"/>
			<v n="43">
				The descendants 
				<crossref let="r" cid="c1500243.1"/>
				 of the following Temple servants returned from exile:Ziha, Hasupha, Tabbaoth,
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v15002044"/>
